  "content": "<h1>GpuTape 🩹</h1><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8457cf2b01e18302ef61da3256328bfb4b94ad14.png\" alt=\"fo\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6c152554bb3141433b6dca087131f96f00a876ba.png\" alt=\"fa\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/554809ee9ae740db0707b7cd1420d937b490cd6b.png\" alt=\"qu\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5d6378864df2d8f2699289ec7f439e26b5c8db60.png\" alt=\"neo\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ca0de18375553419eff9ce315dccceb885971010.png\" alt=\"i\"></p><p>修复显存泄漏问题，基于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvideotape%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\">VideoTape</a>（作者：Anthus/Velum）开发。</p><p>“VideoTape”和“修复显存泄漏”非常相似。我的模组基于“VideoTape”，与“修复显存泄漏”无关。同时使用这些模组不会提升效果！</p><h3>与原版（VideoTape）对比：</h3><ul>\n<li>GpuTape 仅需客户端</li>\n<li>GpuTape 不使用已弃用的 Java 方法（1.19+ 版本）</li>\n<li>GpuTape 支持 Forge、NeoForge 和 Quilt（VideoTape 仅支持 Fabric）</li>\n<li>GpuTape 兼容旧版本（1.18-）</li>\n<li>GpuTape 兼容 Vulkan</li>\n</ul><p><strong>支持的语言🌐（用于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>）：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>英语(en_us) - Mr.Toad</li>\n<li>俄语(ru_ru) - Mr.Toad</li>\n<li>德语(de_de) - Mr.Toad</li>\n<li>乌克兰语(uk_ua) - StarmanMine142</li>\n</ul><h3>我的其他模组：</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fh_plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">H+</a>（新内容与难度提升）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252febe-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnlightenedBlockEntities/EBEReforged</a>（增强方块实体的分支）[已停止更新]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmpalladium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Palladium</a>（性能优化）</li>\n</ul>",
